    "在刘海对话的“常用”菜单里点一条，就把输入框里的文字（空着时用剪贴板）套进去发给当前服务：API 直接回答，网页复制提示词到网页里粘贴，App 复制后打开 App（没装时用浏览器）。内容里写 {文本} 的地方换成那段文字，没写时文字接在内容后面。最多 %@ 条。" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Pick one from the \"Prompts\" menu in the notch chat to wrap the text in the input box (or the clipboard when empty) and send it to the current service: API answers directly, Web copies the prompt for you to paste, App copies it and opens the app (or the browser if it is not installed). {文本} in the content is replaced by that text; without it, the text goes after the content. Up to %@ prompts."
