    "免费版可用 3 个习惯。解锁码头 Pro 后最多 8 个，还能看近七天报告。" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "The free version has 3 habits. Dockling Pro allows up to 8 and adds the 7-day report."
