            "value" : "Drag the shelf"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "指针停在小组件、分组或文件夹上时，用触控板两指朝面板弹出的方向滑一下就打开，反方向滑收起。卡片里能滚动的小组件（比如便签）不受影响，点按照旧。" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "With the pointer on a widget, group or folder, swipe two fingers on the trackpad toward where its panel opens to open it, and the other way to close it. Widgets that scroll inside their card, such as Sticky Note, are left alone, and clicking works as before."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "指针停在扩展栏上时，在外侧浮出当前布局名和页码点，点点或两边的小箭头直接切换；切换布局时也会闪现一下。只有一个布局时不显示。" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "When the pointer rests on the shelf, a small label with the current layout's name and page dots appears beside it. Click a dot or an arrow to switch. It also flashes briefly when you change layouts, and stays hidden when there is only one layout."
          }
        }
      }
    },
