          }
        }
      }
    },
    "码头所有音效的总开关和音量：添加和移除小组件时的轻响，以及提醒到点时的提示音。添加和移除的声音在系统设置里关闭了“播放用户界面音效”时不会播放。" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "One switch and volume for all of Dockling's sounds: the soft click when adding and removing widgets, and the chime when a reminder comes due. The add and remove sounds stay silent when \"Play user interface sound effects\" is off in System Settings."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "码头更新了，助手也要更新一下，更新前上限暂不生效。" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Dockling was updated and the helper needs an update too. The limit is paused until then."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "码头每天向 GitHub 查询一次最新版本号，如果有更新版本，会在菜单栏项中提示你。不会自动安装任何内容，也不会发送其他任何信息。" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Once a day Dockling asks GitHub for the latest version number and lets you know in the menu bar item if there's a newer one. Nothing is installed automatically and nothing else is sent."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "码头没有保存任何 %@ 凭据，因此没有可显示的金额，也没有可绘制的历史数据。" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Dockling has no %@ credentials saved, so there are no amounts to show and no history to draw."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "码头的原作，扩展栏、小组件和应用分组的基础代码。" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "The original Docket: the base code for the shelf, widgets and app groups."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "码头的基础功能一直免费。Pro 解锁下面这些小组件、外观和工具，一次买断，不用订阅。" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Dockling's basics are always free. Pro unlocks the widgets, looks and tools below, as a one-time purchase with no subscription."
          }
        }
      }
    },
